    "catalogue_description": "Style \u2013 Verrukt Perks \u2013 4 Electro \u2013 Traps Easter egg music box Aggressive Zombies Upgraded packer pps in a secret room on the map is hidden pps from multiplayer with a collimator sight The level begins in a funeral home in Soviet Karelia near the old Finnish church (church) near the cemetery. I tried to make a Christmas and New Year atmosphere on the map and convey the feeling of the Russian winter. Have a nice game with friends in co-op and in single player mode, because now it\u2019s easier to play alone and you don\u2019t have to write the name of the card in the console anymore! just start the map from the menu)))",
